1 REM ***************************************************************
2 REM *   C A T A C O M B   O F   T H E   S I L V E R   K E Y       *
3 REM *   A first-person raycast dungeon crawler                    *
4 REM *   Microsoft GW-BASIC 3.2x / BASICA - single source file     *
5 REM *   No extensions, no machine code, no external data files.   *
6 REM *                                                             *
7 REM *   Engine features:                                          *
8 REM *     - DDA grid raycaster, 40 columns, 60 deg FOV            *
9 REM *     - per-column Z-buffer, distance + face shading, dither  *
10 REM *    - billboard sprites, 8x8 bitmask, Z-buffer occlusion    *
11 REM *    - procedural room/corridor dungeon generator            *
12 REM *    - Dijkstra flow-field monster AI (depth limited BFS)    *
13 REM *    - DDA line-of-sight for monster wake-up                 *
14 REM *    - torch fuel drives the light falloff thresholds        *
15 REM *    - DRAW macro language title art, PLAY background music  *
16 REM *    - ON PLAY() event trap keeps the music queue fed        *
17 REM *    - ON KEY() trap for help, ON ERROR trap for disk I/O    *
18 REM *    - sequential-file save / load of the whole world state  *
19 REM ***************************************************************
