3499 REM ================ AUTOMAP ================
3500 LINE (0,0)-(319,127),0,BF
3501 FOR Y=0 TO 31:FOR X=0 TO 31
3502  IF A(X,Y)=1 THEN 3510
3503  PC=1:IF A(X,Y)=2 THEN PC=2
